<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8915] NPE during executing local SqlQuery from client node</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8915</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;NPE when trying to execute &lt;tt&gt;SqlQuery&lt;/tt&gt; with &lt;tt&gt;setLocal(true)&lt;/tt&gt; from client node.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12930098/12930098_IgniteCacheReplicatedClientLocalQuerySelfTest.java&quot; title=&quot;IgniteCacheReplicatedClientLocalQuerySelfTest.java attached to IGNITE-8915&quot;&gt;Reproducer&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;UPD:&lt;br/&gt;
Right behavior:&lt;br/&gt;
Local query should be forbidden and a sensible exception should be thrown if it is executed on client node.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
